Both the word and the speaker are inside the release limit. Karis is the assigned documentary analyst, and the scene explicitly presents this as her second, controlled voicing rather than a discovery. The passage gives no new cosmological meaning, danger, maker, purpose, or connection to the Architect. It stops at the administrative history specifically ordered by the M6 packet.

