| M5 | 28–34 (7) | 36,000 | 12–14 | The keeper chooses; the road cut; a piece of the machine; eighteen |
| M6 | 35–40 (6) | 31,000 | 15–17 | The cache; the analysis and its limits; the honest man's mirror |
