   202	
   203	"Nobody here has asked me for anything," said Vastin. "I noticed that on the landing, and I have been noticing it for two hours." He laid his left hand flat on the scrubbed wood. "So I will save you the asking. There are three things I will not do, and you should go home knowing which."
