+Scope: apply the one exact, single-match listening-proof fix at the end of this recheck. It expands an ambiguous initial in a log entry and does not reopen the repair, alter canon, or require a second repair. All repair-brief items, the five source-distance repairs, the clean-door arithmetic, the chapter 40 count, the reserved-truth amendments, continuity, overlap, gates, and reader clarity pass.
